{
  "_comment": "The house ornament set: real woodcuts from books in the library whose scans may be shared, chosen by eye (2026-11-12). ornaments.mjs cuts each to its block and writes ornaments/<name>.png as an ink mask (black + alpha); build.ts tints them. `crop` (fractions of the gallery crop: left, top, width, height) overrides the automatic cut. plates/device.svg (drawn, not a woodcut) is rendered to ornaments/device.png by plates/render.sh. A letter without an initial gets a plain drop cap.",
